<title>UK: Kotobukiya sets 70 mln Sfr 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kotobukiya sets 70 mln Sfr 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager The Industrial Bank of Japan (Switzerland) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOTOBUKIYA CO LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  THE INDUSTRIAL BANK OF JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT    70 MLN SFR    COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    30.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.375   PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 50	  SALE LIMITS US/JP</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE FROM 30.JAN.98</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
